<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 20mm 16mm 20mm 16mm;
  }
  body {
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "SimSun", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #1e293b;
  }
  .cover {
    page-break-after: always;
    padding-top: 48mm;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cover h1 {
    font-size: 24pt;
    color: #0f2c59;
    margin-bottom: 10mm;
  }
  .cover .meta {
    font-size: 11.5pt;
    color: #475569;
    margin-top: 6mm;
  }
  h2 {
    color: #0f2c59;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #0f2c59;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    page-break-after: avoid;
  }
  h3 {
    color: #1e3a8a;
    margin-top: 14px;
    page-break-after: avoid;
  }
  .toc {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .toc ul { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 10px 0 16px 0;
    font-size: 9pt;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  th { background: #e2e8f0; color: #0f172a; }
  .figure-box {
    margin: 14px 0;
    text-align: center;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .figure-box svg {
    max-width: 96%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .figure-box img {
    max-width: 92%;
    max-height: 110mm;
  }
  .caption {
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: #475569;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .issue-warn {
    background: #fffbeb;
    border-left: 4px solid #d97706;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    margin: 6px 0;
  }
  .issue-err {
    background: #fef2f2;
    border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    margin: 6px 0;
  }
  pre {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding: 8px;
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .page-break { page-break-before: always; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="cover">
  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
  <div class="meta">项目编号：<code>{{ project_id }}</code></div>
  <div class="meta">生成时间：{{ generated_at }}</div>
  <div class="meta">生成引擎：QuantumChem AI（数值全由程序解析，严禁大模型生成数值）</div>
</div>

<div class="toc">
  <strong>目录</strong>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#sec-summary">1. 结论摘要</a></li>
    <li><a href="#sec-methods">2. 计算方法（中 / 英文）</a></li>
    <li><a href="#sec-results">3. 计算结果与可视化</a></li>
    <li><a href="#sec-issues">4. 问题与说明</a></li>
    <li><a href="#sec-appendix">5. 附录（全部作业数据表与基态坐标）</a></li>
    <li><a href="#sec-refs">6. 参考文献</a></li>
  </ul>
</div>

<h2 id="sec-summary">1. 结论摘要</h2>
<p>{{ summary_text }}</p>
{% if ai_interpretation %}
<div class="toc">
  <strong>AI 辅助解读（已通过数值校验）：</strong>
  <p>{{ ai_interpretation }}</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="sec-methods">2. 计算方法</h2>
<h3>2.1 中文方法学</h3>
<p>{{ methods_zh }}</p>
<h3>2.2 Computational Methods (English)</h3>
<p>{{ methods_en }}</p>

<h2 id="sec-results">3. 计算结果与可视化</h2>
{% for cs in cluster_list %}
<h3>3.{{ loop.index }} 体系：{{ cs.cluster_label }}（q={{ cs.charge }}, 基态 M={{ cs.ground_state_multiplicity }}）</h3>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>基态作业</th>
    <th>基态总能量 (Ha)</th>
    <th>平均结合能 Eb (eV/atom)</th>
    <th>HOMO–LUMO 能隙 (eV)</th>
    <th>价电子数（幻数）</th>
    <th>总磁矩 (μB)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>{{ cs.ground_state_job_id }}</code></td>
    <td>{{ "%.6f"|format(cs.ground_state_energy_hartree) }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.3f"|format(cs.binding_energy_ev_per_atom) if cs.binding_energy_ev_per_atom is not none else "—" }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.3f"|format(cs.homo_lumo_gap_ev) if cs.homo_lumo_gap_ev is not none else "—" }}</td>
    <td>{{ cs.valence_electrons }}（{{ "闭壳层幻数" if cs.jellium_magic else "非幻数" }}）</td>
    <td>{{ "%.2f"|format(cs.magnetic_moment_mu_b) }}</td>
  </tr>
</table>
{% endfor %}

{% for fig in figures %}
<div class="figure-box">
  {% if fig.inline_svg %}
    {{ fig.inline_svg | safe }}
  {% elif fig.img_uri %}
    <img src="{{ fig.img_uri }}" alt="{{ fig.caption }}" />
  {% endif %}
  <div class="caption">图 {{ loop.index }}：{{ fig.caption }}</div>
</div>
{% endfor %}

<h2 id="sec-issues">4. 问题与说明</h2>
{% if fixes %}
<h3>4.1 自动自愈修复记录（custodian）</h3>
<ul>
  {% for fix in fixes %}
  <li><code>{{ fix.job_id }}</code>：{{ fix.detail }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>本次计算未触发失败修复重启。</p>
{% endif %}

{% if issues %}
<h3>4.2 异常与物理校验标记</h3>
{% for iss in issues %}
<div class="{{ 'issue-err' if iss.severity == 'error' else 'issue-warn' }}">
  <strong>[{{ iss.code }}]</strong> <code>{{ iss.job_id }}</code> — {{ iss.message }}
</div>
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
<p>全部作业均正常结束，无未处理虚频、波函数不稳定或严重自旋污染。</p>
{% endif %}

<p><strong>搜索范围局限说明：</strong>结构搜索覆盖的能量窗口内候选异构体受计算预算与候选数 K 限制；对于多组分与大尺寸团簇，仍可能存在未采样到的亚稳态构型。</p>

<h2 id="sec-appendix" class="page-break">5. 附录</h2>
<h3>5.1 全部计算作业汇总表</h3>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>作业 ID</th>
    <th>正常结束</th>
    <th>电荷 / 多重度</th>
    <th>总能量 (Ha)</th>
    <th>ZPE (Ha)</th>
    <th>&lt;S²&gt; (前/后)</th>
    <th>虚频数</th>
  </tr>
  {% for r in results %}
  <tr>
    <td><code>{{ r.job_id }}</code></td>
    <td>{{ "✅" if r.normal_termination else "❌ " + (r.error_code or "") }}</td>
    <td>{{ r.state.charge }} / {{ r.state.multiplicity }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.6f"|format(r.energy_hartree) if r.energy_hartree is not none else "—" }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.6f"|format(r.zpe_hartree) if r.zpe_hartree is not none else "—" }}</td>
    <td>{{ "%.4f"|format(r.s2_before) if r.s2_before is not none else "—" }} / {{ "%.4f"|format(r.s2_after) if r.s2_after is not none else "—" }}</td>
    <td>{{ r.imag_freqs|length }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>

{% for cs in cluster_list %}
{% if cs.ground_state_geometry %}
<h3>5.2 {{ cs.cluster_label }} 基态笛卡尔坐标 (Å)</h3>
<pre>{{ cs.ground_state_geometry.symbols|length }}
{{ cs.cluster_label }} (q={{ cs.charge }}, M={{ cs.ground_state_multiplicity }}, E={{ "%.8f"|format(cs.ground_state_energy_hartree) }} Ha)
{% for sym, pos in cs.ground_state_geometry.symbols|zip_lists(cs.ground_state_geometry.positions) %}{{ "%-4s %12.6f %12.6f %12.6f"|format(sym, pos[0], pos[1], pos[2]) }}
{% endfor %}</pre>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<h2 id="sec-refs">6. 参考文献</h2>
<ol>
  {% for ref in references %}
  <li>{{ ref }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>

</body>
</html>
